264
00:35:19,519 --> 00:35:23,840
[SPEAKER_00] Stvaramo li onda na taj način zapravo male i mlade manipulatore?

265
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:25,840
[SPEAKER_01] Između ostalog da.

266
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:27,440
[SPEAKER_01] Između ostalog da.

267
00:35:29,599 --> 00:35:31,519
[SPEAKER_01] Ajmo u onom dijelu o rješenjima kako ne.

268
00:35:34,559 --> 00:35:38,800
[SPEAKER_01] Volim te što ti treba od mene.

269
00:35:39,920 --> 00:35:43,199
[SPEAKER_01] Ja volim reći da naši ljudi ne znaju niti izraziti emocije.

270
00:35:44,079 --> 00:35:48,719
