271
00:35:49,360 --> 00:35:50,639
[SPEAKER_00] A tako, tako, ide nekako.

272
00:35:51,039 --> 00:35:54,400
[SPEAKER_01] To je nešto da u sredini, ali malo samo ispod toga ne ide.

273
00:35:54,800 --> 00:35:55,039
[SPEAKER_01] Zašto?

274
00:35:55,199 --> 00:35:58,559
[SPEAKER_01] Jer nikad nismo naučili od svojih roditelja razgovarati o emocijama.

275
00:35:59,280 --> 00:36:07,039
