309
00:39:02,079 --> 00:39:03,119
[SPEAKER_01] Što je potpuna zamka.

310
00:39:03,280 --> 00:39:06,320
[SPEAKER_01] I onda neki ljudi, pogotovo naravno oni koji su manje zreli.

311
00:39:06,719 --> 00:39:10,159
[SPEAKER_01] Bili oni nezreli odrasli ili naravno djeca, adolescenti.

312
00:39:11,360 --> 00:39:12,559
[SPEAKER_01] Ja danas ne mogu spavati.

313
00:39:12,719 --> 00:39:13,440
[SPEAKER_01] Što da ne napravim?

314
00:39:13,519 --> 00:39:14,880
[SPEAKER_01] Poveže tamo, odgovori ovaj.

315
00:39:15,199 --> 00:39:16,800
[SPEAKER_01] Evo sad sam opet ušao u tu zamku.

316
00:39:17,119 --> 00:39:19,519
[SPEAKER_01] Odgovori, napravi ovako, onako.

317
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:22,480
[SPEAKER_01] Pa osjećam se, tako i tako.

318
00:39:22,800 --> 00:39:23,920
[SPEAKER_01] I onda ide ono pitanje.

319
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:26,719
[SPEAKER_01] Hoćeš li sutra biti ovdje za mene?

320
00:39:27,599 --> 00:39:31,039
[SPEAKER_01] I onda naravno odgovor ide, naravno ja sam uvijek tu za tebe.

321
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:35,039
[SPEAKER_01] Stvara se odnos sa strojem.

322
00:39:36,159 --> 00:39:36,239
[SPEAKER_00] Da.

323
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:38,639
[SPEAKER_01] A odnos je varka.

324
00:39:39,119 --> 00:39:41,119
[SPEAKER_01] To nije odnos koji uključuje reciprocitet.

325
00:39:41,599 --> 00:39:42,960
